export anchor ZIndex:
    description:
        Sets the stacking order of a positioned component and its descendants. Higher values are drawn above lower ones within the same stacking context; any integer value also creates a new stacking context.

    identifier: zIndex

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `z-index` property.

    values:
        - `auto`
        - `<integer>`

    initial: auto

    appliesTo: Positioned components (position other than static).

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            zIndex: 10
        \\\
        ```
